  "prefLabel": "Plc 606.01 Licensee Obligations to Notify",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 606.01 Licensee Obligations to Notify. Each licensee shall comply with Plc 307.02 relative to required notifications, updates of contact information, and providing information on how complaints can be filed.\n\nSource. #14631, eff 9-21-26, EXPIRES: 9-21-36",
